      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在人人皆知的赛事杂志《月刊闪耀》中，\n她获得了单独刊登报道的机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba591a9aec98f40f7a2c14812a9d3c79cfdf310d83798340e67b0366beea8ad7",
