    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ef5a05bb4c9e9c288c07f25",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个——是摆成，这个姿势吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "70fd89c4fb515a959cd974a081aefeb6a907f06593fc525eca8b89236ca28acb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d94e1eaffb00342737d3ad8a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以首席训练员的名气为契机，\n极具天赋的她，\n终于开始真正受到了世人的瞩目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a7f86fd1927a5db0c607afe1e2afee08e3088402b78de55d1a827e26d816b87",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80734aa7fe59c539fcfd6f00",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今后她大显身手的舞台一定会更加广阔吧。\n这或许也会对她今后的赛事成绩产生积极的影响。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df61511b0e20c1a0a120d5db164befd2defb149b068b5816fc682a288a203367",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98e5a5bf18cc623a2529c4c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是再好不过的事了。\n这明明是我无法为她做到的事情，\n我也由衷地感到无比欣慰，可是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "50249253ee6eeb57d10d8435f6f2eb60fee6183d340e5a953f9e35ef13682268",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a23684119428811f1faf2e98",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——此时正在指导她的人，\n是我在担任助理训练员时期曾关照过我的、\n一位经验极其丰富的首席训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0b3a4a854a2e73aa546bb0f8431f1f5c2f3e09fc03b97299d09f62d2cb92cef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
